Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:10.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,WaterWatch is an offline field notebook that screens drinking water samples against federal reference levels, now with an SDG 6 clean-water equity lab built in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:17.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,Everything runs in this one page, and its security policy forbids network connections, so nothing ever leaves the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:22.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,The School tap preset is a synthetic first draw at an older elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:31.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Lead reads 24.6 parts per billion against the 10 part action level, while the same fountain after a flush reads 3.1.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:37.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,The report keeps both lead action levels on screen as context and never calls either one a safety verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:43.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Industrial corridor preset, a synthetic private well, shows why the mixture matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.74,0:00:56.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,No single PFAS reading tops its own benchmark, yet four contributions sum to a Hazard Index of exactly 1.27, flagged above the limit of 1 beside the rule's one significant figure display.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.94,0:01:04.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,After the storm, a boil advisory pairs with a microbial detection and nitrate at 13.6 milligrams per liter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:12.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,The guidance is bottled water first and the boil notice exactly as issued; the filter table warns a household filter is not an advisory fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.02,0:01:21.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Sliding evaporation to 20 percent turns 13.6 into 17, because boiling off water only concentrates what stays behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:27.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,The mixture and sensitivity lab compares all four presets against every benchmark at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:34.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,It draws the Hazard Index breakdown and the per-contaminant ratio chart, then runs its deterministic checks in the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:37.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,All 32 in-page self-tests pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:43.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,The audited brief stamps one SHA-256 digest across the on-page line and every export.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:52.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,The SDG 6 lab grades the service ladder, the exceedance profile, and an illustrative water stress index for that same sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:58.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,Five low-cost interventions are priced against the grant budget, and the planner recommends the best modeled reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:06.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,A fit badge says plainly when an option covers the reported gaps, and an active advisory withholds every contaminant-fit claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.24,0:02:12.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,On the impact chart every marker is focusable, and every label declutters itself instead of colliding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:17.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,One tap renders the whole lab in Spanish, indicators, planner and chart included.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:28.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,The same recording run verified 695 of 695 Node tests, 56 of 56 headless audit checks, and zero honesty findings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:34.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Everything shown was computed in the page during this drive, with zero network requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:37.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,WaterWatch. Know what is in your tap.
